# Sensitive runtime configuration and SSH trust data
# 注意：以下模式必须锚定到仓库根目录。若写成不带前导斜杠的 `config.json`，
# 会连 `examples/config.json` 这类本应入库的模板文件一起忽略。
/config.json
/config.json.lock
/known_hosts
.tauri/
*.key
*.key.pub


# Rust build output and project-local Cargo cache
target/
.cargo/

# Desktop frontend dependencies and build output
apps/desktop/node_modules/
apps/desktop/dist/

# Local AI workspace records and helper code
报告/ai_codes/
报告/ai_docs/
.workbuddy-ai/

.opencode/
AGENTS.md
agent.md

# Tauri generates these schemas during builds
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/

# Unused icon variants generated by Tauri's icon command
apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/*.png
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/icon.png
apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/android/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/ios/
# Editor and operating-system files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
Thumbs.db
